    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίσῠνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span> (not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
