			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξοισιν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				5.205
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνορέῃ π. καὶ κάρτεϊ χειρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				506
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
